              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MrsFritz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As written, the dough was way to sticky to roll into anything and I had to add more flour. The dough has to be VERY cold before even thinking of rolling out. Once baked cookies are cake-like and puff up a LOT.",
            "datePublished": "2010-02-07T13:28:37.780Z"
          },
          {
